{"id":"SMA-631","uuid":"eccc9f1e-85a7-4a81-83c1-6fe3a136513f","title":"ts: shared home for console principal provisioning and the Introspect resolver","description":"<issue id="b2583bd7-db16-4d86-8afb-28ea20683b85" href="https://linear.app/smaschek/issue/SMA-511/ts-iam-console-app-the-iam-zone">SMA-511</issue> puts the provisioning call, `IntrospectPrincipalResolver`, `currentPrincipal()` and `mayI()` in `ts/apps/iam-console/lib/` (spec § 4.5, § 4.6).

They live in the app because `@paigasus/auth` must not import `@paigasus/sdk`, and the `sdk` boundary rule bans every `@paigasus/*` import except `proto`. Only an app may depend on both.

<issue id="d93e1e93-11b7-4f47-84b7-4397ff3bf878" href="https://linear.app/smaschek/issue/SMA-512/ts-gateway-console-app-the-ai-gateway-zone">SMA-512</issue> (gateway-console) needs the same code. When it does, move the code to one shared place instead of a second copy. Options to decide then: a new package that may depend on both `auth` and `sdk`, or an adapter subpath with its own boundary rule.","projectMilestone":{"id":"cc347594-049d-454e-9f8c-69246ba056b7","name":"Frontend"},"priority":{"value":0,"name":"No priority"},"url":"https://linear.app/smaschek/issue/SMA-631/ts-shared-home-for-console-principal-provisioning-and-the-introspect","gitBranchName":"feature/sma-631-ts-shared-home-for-console-principal-provisioning-and-the","createdAt":"2026-09-11T18:40:50.259Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-14T05:26:12.841Z","archivedAt":null,"completedAt":"2026-09-14T05:26:12.823Z","startedAt":"2026-09-14T04:39:23.772Z","canceledAt":null,"dueDate":null,"slaStartedAt":null,"slaMediumRiskAt":null,"slaHighRiskAt":null,"slaBreachesAt":null,"status":"Done","statusType":"completed","labels":["area:frontend"],"attachments":[{"id":"42b2fbf8-d58a-4a83-8d00-623149e46976","title":"refactor(ts): extract @paigasus/console-core from iam-console (SMA-512)","subtitle":null,"url":"https://github.com/SMK1085/paigasus-core/pull/239"}],"documents":[],"createdBy":"Sven Maschek","createdById":"ba6021cb-56c5-43aa-9797-fab3599d7ead","assignee":"Sven Maschek","assigneeId":"ba6021cb-56c5-43aa-9797-fab3599d7ead","project":"Paigasus Polyglot","projectId":"94351cc4-6a23-4c34-a043-2e7f1bfd9ae4","team":"Sven Maschek","teamId":"7178572e-d61f-4cf0-bbcb-4e03c8d9f39e"}

